@HostAddress = http://localhost:5210

### 1. View Dashboard Statistics
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/dashboard/stats
Accept: application/json

### 2. View All Available Rooms (with optional filters)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/rooms/available?roomType=&maxRate=6000
Accept: application/json

### 3. View All Rooms
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/rooms
Accept: application/json

### 4. Create / Add a New Room
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dormitoryId": 1,
  "roomNumber": "Room 105",
  "roomType": "Single Private",
  "capacity": 1,
  "monthlyRate": 4800.00,
  "status": "Available"
}

### 5. Pay Rent (Pay rent for an active lease)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "leaseId": 1,
  "amountPaid": 4500.00,
  "paymentMethod": "GCash",
  "referenceNumber": "GCASH-SAMPLE-12345"
}

### 6. View All Rent Payments
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/payments
Accept: application/json

### 7. View Rent Payments & Statement of Account for a Specific Lease
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/payments/lease/1
Accept: application/json

### 8. View Payment Summary / Financial Metrics
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/payments/summary
Accept: application/json

### 9. View All Active Leases
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/leases/active
Accept: application/json

### 10. Check-In Tenant / Create New Lease
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/leases
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 2,
  "roomId": 3,
  "startDate": "2026-10-12T00:00:00Z",
  "endDate": "2027-04-12T00:00:00Z",
  "status": "Active"
}

### 11. Check-Out Tenant / Terminate Lease
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/leases/1/terminate
Accept: application/json

### 12. View Reservations
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/reservations
Accept: application/json

### 13. Create Room Reservation
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 2,
  "roomId": 2,
  "status": "Pending"
}

### 14. Approve Reservation
PUT {{HostAddress}}/api/reservations/1/approve
Accept: application/json

### 15. View Maintenance Requests
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/maintenancerequests
Accept: application/json

### 16. Submit Maintenance Issue
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/maintenancerequests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomId": 1,
  "userId": 2,
  "issueDescription": "Air conditioning unit is not blowing cold air.",
  "status": "Pending"
}

### 17. Update Maintenance Request Status to Resolved
PUT {{HostAddress}}/api/maintenancerequests/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Resolved"
}

### 18. View All Dormitory Buildings & Occupancy
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/dormitories
Accept: application/json

### 19. View Users / Tenants
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/users?role=Tenant
Accept: application/json

### 20. Reseed Sample Test Data
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/seed/reset
Accept: application/json
